potion of invisibility, quaff it, and then take out the shopkeeper
(wand of striking, and any ranged weapons).  Might work.  Either he
gets out, and may or may not be permanently invisible, or he runs out
of ranged options & has to try to find something else.  Can't be worse
than his current situation, I wouldn't think.

